{"id":"desconocido","lemma":"desconocido","pos":"adj","rank":2020,"glosses":["unknown, undisclosed, unbeknownst","unfamiliar","uncharted, undiscovered"],"ipa":"/deskonoˈθido/","forms":{"feminine":"desconocida","masculinePlural":"desconocidos","femininePlural":"desconocidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-desconocido.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto no es nuevo ni desconocido.","en":"This is neither new nor unknown.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"new"},{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},null]},{"text":"Me siento bastante a gusto entre desconocidos.","en":"I feel quite at ease among strangers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693268","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"quite"},null,null,{"g":"between"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"at ease, comfortable"]]},{"text":"Vi entrar a un desconocido en esa casa.","en":"I saw a stranger enter that house.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534377","words":[{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"to enter"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"house"}]},{"text":"Un desconocido me llamó ayer por teléfono.","en":"A stranger phoned me yesterday.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to summon, to call","l":"llamar"},{"g":"yesterday"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"telephone"}]},{"text":"Mi perro ladra a los desconocidos.","en":"My dog barks at strangers.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"dog"},{"g":"bark"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}